        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Employee’s may exhaust all of their annual leave balance during one continuous period of absence and for any reason, insofar as mission requirements permit. Supervisors cannot require that Employee’s maintain a minimum annual leave balance. Supervisors may request justification for leave, however, it is not required.",
